<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37078" root="كفت" body-key="k">
    
      7 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انكفت</span></b>  <i>He turned away,</i> or <i>became averted,</i>
or <i>diverted,</i> [<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَنْ وَجْهِهِ</span> <i>from his course,</i> or
<i>design</i>]. (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>He returned</i> [<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عن وجهه</span> <i>from
his course,</i> or <i>design;</i> and] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِلَى مَنْزِلِهِ</span> <i>to his
abode.</i> (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <i>He,</i> or <i>it, became contracted;</i>
(K;) and so ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استكفت</span></b> . (TA in art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سكف</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>It</i> (a garment) <i>was drawn up,</i> or
<i>tucked up, and contracted.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <i>He was
compact in make.</i> (K, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <i>He</i> (a horse)
<i>was lean, lank, slender, light of flesh,</i> or
<i>lank in the belly.</i> (K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انكفت لَوْنُهُ</span> <i>His,</i>
or <i>its, colour changed.</i> (TA, art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كفأ</span>.)

